==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Squirtle|29}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Squirtle}}.
*{{m|Water Gun}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Squirtle}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

